ngeon\">Astral Shaper Dungeon</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It is an <a href=\"#/wiki/Imbuing%20Shrine\">Imbuing Shrine</a> which has been abandoned. When using it, it will say: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">It seems this old device is missing a kind of energy source. It clearly shows signs of use and probably had a specific purpose</span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Constructions</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/forgotten-knowledge-quest\">Forgotten Knowledge Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Imbuing%20Shrine\">Imbuing Shrine</a></li><li>Shrines and Altars</li><li>Utilities</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["forgotten-knowledge-quest"]}